# Guest Page

- **Message**: Clearly explain that saving, analysis, and optimization require an account; keep the copy short and focused on benefits rather than limitations.
- **CTA**: Provide a primary CTA to sign in or sign up and an optional secondary action to try a limited guest experience; keep them visually distinct.
- **Consistency**: Match the visual style of the main landing page (hero, typography, teal accents) so the guest page feels integrated rather than a separate product.
- **Upgrade moments**: Within any guest-only UI, gently nudge users to create an account with short, contextual prompts instead of intrusive banners.

